WEBVTT

00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:03.870
Asakura, Hakusan...

00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:06.460
Akamatsu, Ooe...

00:00:06.920 --> 00:00:08.740
Saitou, Uraise...

00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:13.510
And Togakushi in Takeda's lands.

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:19.080
His appearances are unpredictable, 
just like the demon Rasetsu.

00:00:19.730 --> 00:00:21.580
According to da Vinci-dono,

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:24.910
these pylons have been 
developed so that the West

00:00:24.910 --> 00:00:26.590
can control the ley lines.

00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:29.870
These are part of five
 key locations called "knots,"

00:00:29.870 --> 00:00:32.120
all critical hubs for the
 flow of Eastern ley lines.

00:00:32.530 --> 00:00:34.090
The fifth knot is here,

00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:36.370
Oomiwa in Yamatai.

00:00:36.910 --> 00:00:39.790
We have already sent
 messengers to the surrounding lands.

00:00:39.790 --> 00:00:43.800
We're working to gain their support 
in defending the land of Yamatai.

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:44.890
In addition...

00:00:46.010 --> 00:00:46.880
Nobu?

00:00:47.130 --> 00:00:50.200
Mitsu, we are one step behind.

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:51.110
What?

00:00:51.520 --> 00:00:53.120
Yamatai has already fallen.

00:00:53.710 --> 00:00:55.910
How can you be sure?

00:01:01.240 --> 00:01:02.820
Yamatai's ley lines...!

00:01:04.380 --> 00:01:06.230
It's too late.

00:01:19.910 --> 00:01:23.110
Yomotsuhirasaka now belongs to King Arthur.

00:01:34.300 --> 00:01:35.690
I see...

00:01:35.690 --> 00:01:37.850
This is the Knot of Gordias.

00:03:19.850 --> 00:03:23.950
We remain cut off from the 
ley lines' energy supply.

00:03:24.510 --> 00:03:26.340
Most of our machines are inoperable,

00:03:26.340 --> 00:03:28.420
including our Giant War Armor units.

00:03:29.170 --> 00:03:31.400
Our people are afraid.

00:03:32.110 --> 00:03:34.010
We'd like to begin relief efforts soon.

00:03:34.010 --> 00:03:34.840
<i>My betrothed.</i>

00:03:36.190 --> 00:03:38.990
Yamatai's defense
 systems are still operational.

00:03:40.080 --> 00:03:42.190
The ley line barriers 
must have been breached.

00:03:42.690 --> 00:03:44.360
Then why the blackout?

00:03:45.160 --> 00:03:49.220
The emergency defense systems
 must have shut down the ley lines.

00:03:51.150 --> 00:03:52.830
Himiko, get ready.

00:03:53.220 --> 00:03:54.800
We're heading to Yamatai right now.

00:04:01.250 --> 00:04:02.770
There is no need.

00:04:02.770 --> 00:04:03.310
<i>What?</i>

00:04:03.730 --> 00:04:06.290
I have wed into the Oda clan.

00:04:06.810 --> 00:04:08.270
It is of critical importance

00:04:08.270 --> 00:04:11.660
to reinforce the Yomotsuhirasaka's 
defenses right now.

00:04:12.120 --> 00:04:13.630
Alexander is attempting

00:04:13.630 --> 00:04:16.420
to seize control of this star's 
ley lines through brute force.

00:04:17.680 --> 00:04:18.690
Himiko...

00:04:21.860 --> 00:04:23.430
Follow the prophecies

00:04:24.180 --> 00:04:25.900
and press onward without fear!

00:04:27.880 --> 00:04:32.110
Should Yomotsuhirasaka
 fall into Alexander's grasp,

00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:35.660
the Ladder to Heaven will be 
under their complete control.

00:04:36.140 --> 00:04:39.110
The Star of the West will
 no doubt launch a full invasion

00:04:39.110 --> 00:04:41.620
and will certainly
 send their entire force.

00:04:43.470 --> 00:04:44.980
Ready a ship!

00:04:44.980 --> 00:04:46.710
I am going to Yomotsuhirasaka.

00:04:54.190 --> 00:04:56.430
It has been a while
 since I last hunted dragons.

00:05:11.000 --> 00:05:13.200
The Palais Natura has departed?

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:16.540
Where are we headed?

00:05:27.460 --> 00:05:29.500
We have brought
 General Caesar, Your Majesty.

00:05:42.200 --> 00:05:43.970
I have been waiting for you.

00:05:44.700 --> 00:05:46.600
You will punish me, will you not?

00:05:47.140 --> 00:05:48.800
There is no need.

00:05:49.210 --> 00:05:49.980
Why?

00:05:50.740 --> 00:05:52.880
Would you forgive me?
 I, who have turned my blade

00:05:52.880 --> 00:05:54.340
against my Round Table brothers?

00:05:54.950 --> 00:05:59.350
You must have had just cause to do so.

00:06:00.230 --> 00:06:01.300
Well...

00:06:02.720 --> 00:06:07.390
I am glad that I sent
 you to the Star of the East.

00:06:09.490 --> 00:06:13.040
To expand knowledge
 without being held hostage

00:06:13.040 --> 00:06:14.870
by our antiquated values...

00:06:15.790 --> 00:06:18.670
That is an invaluable experience.

00:06:19.270 --> 00:06:21.940
It is all for true salvation.

00:06:23.900 --> 00:06:27.250
Then why do we engage
 in acts that abandon people

00:06:27.250 --> 00:06:29.450
worthy of salvation to die?

00:06:29.830 --> 00:06:31.110
Abandon them to die?

00:06:31.890 --> 00:06:33.760
I have seen with my own eyes

00:06:34.480 --> 00:06:37.810
how General Cesare set 
fire to the village of Donremy

00:06:38.220 --> 00:06:40.370
and let the people burn.

00:06:42.970 --> 00:06:47.400
The general stated that the 
villagers need not be saved.

00:06:47.400 --> 00:06:50.570
Is that your belief, as well, Your Majesty?

00:06:51.800 --> 00:06:52.570
Indeed.

00:06:52.830 --> 00:06:54.180
But why?!

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:56.410
If you seek to save all men,

00:06:56.410 --> 00:06:59.980
how can you allow entire 
villages to be sacrificed—

00:06:59.980 --> 00:07:02.720
Ah, General Caesar!

00:07:08.090 --> 00:07:10.280
Your Majesty.

00:07:14.220 --> 00:07:15.870
Do you truly believe

00:07:15.870 --> 00:07:20.940
that I feel no pain over 
the deaths of multitudes?

00:07:20.940 --> 00:07:22.600
W-Well...

00:07:23.070 --> 00:07:25.310
You have spoken truly.

00:07:26.070 --> 00:07:32.100
I have allowed many lives to be
 lost for the sake of true salvation...

00:07:33.170 --> 00:07:35.660
This has gone on longer
 than you can ever imagine.

00:07:37.120 --> 00:07:40.280
In truth, death is but a passing point.

00:07:40.760 --> 00:07:45.100
True salvation will be
 attained when I hold the Holy Grail.

00:07:46.320 --> 00:07:47.550
But...

00:07:53.850 --> 00:07:55.730
In order to save this star,

00:07:55.730 --> 00:07:59.650
I must know grief equal to the 
number of lives that will be lost.

00:08:00.220 --> 00:08:06.320
I know not how to stop
 these tears of grief from falling.

00:08:06.730 --> 00:08:08.050
This grief burdens my heart.

00:08:12.050 --> 00:08:13.550
Ah, King Arthur!

00:08:13.550 --> 00:08:16.340
The Aphrodite of my soul!

00:08:17.990 --> 00:08:19.650
General Caesar,

00:08:20.260 --> 00:08:21.740
please lend me your

00:08:21.740 --> 00:08:24.850
strength so that we
 can overcome this grief

00:08:24.850 --> 00:08:27.140
and enter a millennium full of joy.

00:08:36.750 --> 00:08:37.660
This is...!

00:08:38.120 --> 00:08:42.920
This is Excalibur, the oldest Regalia 
that slumbers on the Palais Natura.

00:08:43.670 --> 00:08:47.280
If you truly desire salvation,

00:08:47.280 --> 00:08:50.660
Excalibur shall give you strength.

00:08:51.920 --> 00:08:54.930
True... salvation.

00:09:20.710 --> 00:09:23.030
Let us make manifest a sacred world...

00:09:24.530 --> 00:09:26.940
...and attain perfect harmony!

00:09:32.890 --> 00:09:33.670
Hurry!

00:09:34.160 --> 00:09:37.670
We must not allow Alexander to
 dissolve Yomotsuhirasaka's barrier!

00:09:39.590 --> 00:09:43.340
What has happened to
 Nobunaga at Yomotsuhirasaka?

00:09:46.730 --> 00:09:51.520
My betrothed has allowed the
 ley lines of this star to devour him.

00:09:51.940 --> 00:09:53.020
Devour?

00:09:53.500 --> 00:09:56.530
What? You don't understand 
what that means, either?

00:09:56.530 --> 00:09:57.700
But...!

00:10:02.780 --> 00:10:05.410
Devoured by the dragons,

00:10:05.410 --> 00:10:07.170
they now reside within him.

00:10:07.780 --> 00:10:11.350
The ley lines of the East and my betrothed

00:10:11.350 --> 00:10:14.040
are now bound by nigh-inseparable ties.

00:10:15.740 --> 00:10:17.180
Just like me.

00:10:20.290 --> 00:10:22.730
Are you absolutely certain

00:10:23.310 --> 00:10:26.290
that the voice you heard in
 Yomotsuhirasaka was to my betrothed?

00:10:26.290 --> 00:10:26.920
What?

00:10:26.920 --> 00:10:28.390
That may have been a dragon

00:10:28.830 --> 00:10:31.360
who just borrowed my betrothed's voice.

00:10:31.820 --> 00:10:34.700
If so, he is mine.

00:10:38.700 --> 00:10:41.190
What do you believe is the 
difference between the

00:10:41.190 --> 00:10:42.880
Savior-King and the Destroyer-King?

00:10:42.880 --> 00:10:43.810
The difference?

00:10:44.110 --> 00:10:47.590
I wish to know every law of the universe,

00:10:48.530 --> 00:10:51.450
no matter where that endeavor may take me.

00:10:51.890 --> 00:10:52.980
Da Vinci...

00:10:53.720 --> 00:10:54.720
Da Vinci.

00:10:55.300 --> 00:10:57.300
I don't care if you come along,

00:10:57.850 --> 00:10:59.920
but I cannot guarantee your safety,

00:10:59.920 --> 00:11:01.980
no matter what harm may befall you.

00:11:02.440 --> 00:11:03.330
Do you understand?

00:11:03.660 --> 00:11:08.230
I have something I must 
ask of General Alexander.

00:11:08.790 --> 00:11:11.580
This is the chance of a lifetime.

00:11:11.580 --> 00:11:12.970
Please do not be concerned.

00:11:13.350 --> 00:11:14.440
I see.

00:11:14.440 --> 00:11:15.810
You do not lack courage.

00:12:02.970 --> 00:12:04.020
Listen up!

00:12:04.020 --> 00:12:05.980
Assume the War Armors are not an option!

00:12:05.980 --> 00:12:07.860
Squad Two reporting full evacuation!

00:12:07.860 --> 00:12:09.930
Transfer supplies from Walls 7 and 16 to Wall 8!

00:12:09.930 --> 00:12:11.650
If there are able-bodied men to help,

00:12:11.650 --> 00:12:13.210
send them to a commanding officer!

00:12:13.210 --> 00:12:15.320
Set that house on fire!

00:12:17.570 --> 00:12:19.900
Everyone, this way please.

00:12:19.900 --> 00:12:23.150
Come, it's warm near the fire!

00:12:23.150 --> 00:12:27.820
Takeda clansmen and
 Caesar-sama's servants are welcome!

00:12:30.650 --> 00:12:31.930
Chacha, Hatsu.

00:12:33.090 --> 00:12:34.840
What are you doing?

00:12:35.290 --> 00:12:38.550
We are setting fire to the
 buildings at Ichihime-sama's request.

00:12:55.590 --> 00:12:57.790
Homes are nothing
 without people to dwell there.

00:12:58.410 --> 00:13:00.940
These buildings may wish
 to be transformed into fire.

00:13:02.480 --> 00:13:05.350
Will there be another war?

00:13:05.740 --> 00:13:07.820
That depends on Nobu.

00:13:08.730 --> 00:13:11.490
The Nobu who returned 
from Yomotsuhirasaka

00:13:11.490 --> 00:13:13.080
is not the Nobu I once knew.

00:13:13.410 --> 00:13:14.090
Oh?

00:13:15.160 --> 00:13:17.330
It is as though he has become a dragon.

00:13:19.480 --> 00:13:22.990
You have finally come
 to know my brother at last.

00:13:23.930 --> 00:13:27.530
The brother I've known since childhood

00:13:27.530 --> 00:13:30.960
is one who struggles amidst the chaos.

00:13:30.960 --> 00:13:32.970
It is the measure of who 
he is as Oda Nobunaga,

00:13:33.470 --> 00:13:35.980
a warrior who will rule heaven and earth.

00:13:36.410 --> 00:13:39.220
Are you not worried about Nobu?

00:13:39.220 --> 00:13:42.300
I have always thought that 
dominion and my brother

00:13:42.300 --> 00:13:43.990
are one and the same,

00:13:44.830 --> 00:13:50.230
but is there any truth in a unity 
achieved by relying on another?

00:13:51.020 --> 00:13:55.830
Nobu has always followed his own goals.

00:13:55.830 --> 00:13:58.230
No matter what he may
 have done at Yomotsuhirasaka,

00:13:58.230 --> 00:14:00.000
he has not changed.

00:14:00.830 --> 00:14:04.300
In a way, dominion is
 a path for one to follow.

00:14:04.820 --> 00:14:07.740
It can be mine or yours.

00:14:08.790 --> 00:14:13.830
I never expected to hear you
 speak of such things, Ichihime-sama.

00:14:14.220 --> 00:14:16.730
What matters is whether 
something is accomplished,

00:14:16.730 --> 00:14:18.250
not who will accomplish it.

00:14:18.710 --> 00:14:20.870
I have finally come to realize this fact.

00:14:25.130 --> 00:14:28.410
The area is sealed by an 
unknown arcane technology.

00:14:28.410 --> 00:14:30.900
It will take some time to dismantle it.

00:14:31.770 --> 00:14:33.900
The Knot of Gordias...

00:14:34.440 --> 00:14:36.590
If it can't be undone,
 then it must be cut down.

00:14:36.590 --> 00:14:37.910
Lower your sword.

00:14:41.380 --> 00:14:43.280
Leonardo da Vinci...

00:14:43.630 --> 00:14:47.050
It has been a while, General Alexander.

00:14:47.440 --> 00:14:50.220
Did you come here so
 that I might behead you?

00:14:50.220 --> 00:14:52.110
An intriguing prospect.

00:14:52.110 --> 00:14:56.530
The champions of the East
 and West are about to do battle.

00:14:56.530 --> 00:14:58.290
I could hardly miss such a sight.

00:14:58.850 --> 00:15:03.900
Besides, I'd like to look
 more closely at Yomotsuhirasaka.

00:15:04.470 --> 00:15:09.110
I am wondering if the secret of 
the Savior-King is hidden here.

00:15:11.150 --> 00:15:13.080
General Alexander,

00:15:13.080 --> 00:15:17.040
have you ever seen King Arthur's face?

00:15:17.040 --> 00:15:18.450
Why are you asking?

00:15:18.800 --> 00:15:20.470
If I do not know his face,

00:15:20.470 --> 00:15:21.950
I cannot paint him.

00:15:22.240 --> 00:15:23.110
Hmph.

00:15:23.110 --> 00:15:27.940
Da Vinci, know that curiosity killed the cat.

00:15:28.990 --> 00:15:31.620
Can you stop me, Nobunaga?

00:15:32.570 --> 00:15:33.730
It is inevitable.

00:15:33.730 --> 00:15:36.100
Please tell me, General!

00:15:36.100 --> 00:15:38.600
What did King Arthur look like?

00:15:39.050 --> 00:15:41.670
He looked like a man among men, like a god.

00:15:41.670 --> 00:15:43.340
Mere words cannot express it!

00:15:47.640 --> 00:15:49.240
Destroyer-King!

00:16:12.400 --> 00:16:13.900
Oda Nobunaga,

00:16:13.900 --> 00:16:15.150
have you become a demon now

00:16:15.150 --> 00:16:16.970
that a dragon has devoured you?

00:16:17.270 --> 00:16:18.490
If that makes me a demon,

00:16:18.490 --> 00:16:20.210
then you, dragon-devourer, are my match.

00:16:21.200 --> 00:16:21.980
Nobunaga!

00:16:25.320 --> 00:16:28.690
You must merely observe
 this battle between men.

00:16:30.450 --> 00:16:33.300
Relish this blade,
 the sword of a dragon enraged!

00:16:33.300 --> 00:16:34.410
Ludicrous!

00:16:34.410 --> 00:16:36.960
Dragons deserve only subjugation!

00:16:45.910 --> 00:16:49.200
So this is the roar of the
 dragons of the East and West.

00:16:49.590 --> 00:16:50.640
Dragons...

00:17:09.900 --> 00:17:10.990
What is this?

00:17:10.990 --> 00:17:12.560
What the?

00:17:21.190 --> 00:17:22.440
Get down!

00:17:41.860 --> 00:17:43.960
Schroedinger's box has opened.

00:17:44.320 --> 00:17:45.290
What?

00:17:45.290 --> 00:17:47.960
Yomotsuhirasaka is a
 place where life and death,

00:17:47.960 --> 00:17:50.990
and many possible futures coexist.

00:17:51.540 --> 00:17:54.190
But its space-time has
 now been torn asunder,

00:17:54.190 --> 00:17:56.470
and its possible futures reduced to one.

00:17:57.010 --> 00:18:00.030
Now, the question is life or death.

00:18:05.480 --> 00:18:08.220
It appears the ley line
 energy has been restored.

00:18:14.790 --> 00:18:17.360
We're at full strength thanks to that, too!

00:18:22.160 --> 00:18:24.560
Let your rapidity be that of the wind!

00:18:32.190 --> 00:18:36.850
I am a warrior returned from the brink 
of death! Cyborg Toyotomi Hideyoshi

00:18:37.210 --> 00:18:39.130
has arrived!

00:18:39.610 --> 00:18:40.480
Monkey!

00:18:40.480 --> 00:18:41.620
Hideyoshi!

00:18:41.620 --> 00:18:43.860
It appears he has made a full recovery.

00:18:47.150 --> 00:18:49.430
Monkey, I am glad you have returned!

00:18:49.430 --> 00:18:51.000
Of course I have!

00:18:51.000 --> 00:18:57.500
I can't die until I've seen 
Nobu-sama rule heaven and earth!

00:18:57.690 --> 00:19:01.530
I have used Eastern technology to 
miniaturize a quantum condenser,

00:19:01.530 --> 00:19:03.690
which I transplanted into Sir Hideyoshi.

00:19:04.210 --> 00:19:08.010
You could say he is Hideyoshi Mark II.

00:19:08.220 --> 00:19:11.510
I'm feeling even better now!

00:19:11.720 --> 00:19:14.610
Now, let the people come.

00:19:23.610 --> 00:19:24.790
Caesar, is that you?

00:19:28.890 --> 00:19:32.450
Now he's finally bothering to show his face?

00:19:32.450 --> 00:19:33.540
He's alive.

00:19:52.720 --> 00:19:56.020
In the name of Gaius Julius Caesar,
 I command thee.

00:19:56.020 --> 00:20:00.640
Show yourself to me, Dais of Hercules!

00:20:10.710 --> 00:20:13.190
King Arthur, look!

00:20:13.190 --> 00:20:17.550
I shall manifest the bridge
 between the two stars here and now!

00:20:17.730 --> 00:20:20.780
Appear, Pillars of Hercules!

00:20:57.710 --> 00:20:58.610
What's going on?!

00:20:59.040 --> 00:21:00.430
The Ladder to Heaven?

00:21:15.790 --> 00:21:17.310
We'll get thrown off! Hold on!

00:21:17.310 --> 00:21:18.170
Sever the hawser!

00:21:21.440 --> 00:21:22.990
Ah, Palais Natura!

00:21:22.990 --> 00:21:25.080
King Arthur has finally come to this star!

00:21:25.080 --> 00:21:26.310
What did you say?!

00:21:30.010 --> 00:21:31.610
A black sun...

00:21:32.040 --> 00:21:34.090
How ominous.

00:21:34.980 --> 00:21:36.650
Yomotsuhirasaka has been...

00:21:40.660 --> 00:21:41.940
My betrothed!

00:21:49.870 --> 00:21:52.540
Nobu-sama, we should retreat!

00:21:53.980 --> 00:21:55.070
I will not let you escape!

00:21:55.070 --> 00:21:56.060
Lord Alexander!

00:21:56.060 --> 00:21:56.610
General!

00:21:57.580 --> 00:21:59.450
Oda Nobunaga!

00:22:03.910 --> 00:22:06.660
Dragon of the East...

00:22:14.120 --> 00:22:16.000
It feels so empty.

00:22:16.000 --> 00:22:19.360
<i>That man is the Destroyer-King.</i>

00:22:19.800 --> 00:22:24.150
<i>Jeanne, Oda Nobunaga
 is the Destroyer-King.</i>

00:24:11.300 --> 00:24:15.100
A blossom of fortitude quietly 
blooms with vivid splendor,

00:24:15.100 --> 00:24:17.330
then scatters.

00:24:17.930 --> 00:24:19.250
You are that flower.

00:24:19.760 --> 00:24:21.580
Next time: Justice.

00:24:21.960 --> 00:24:25.260
I want to illuminate this 
path without hesitation.
